  gods:
  - key: hyperaxis
    name: Hyperaxis, the Stormcrown
    domain: "Sky \xB7 Thunder \xB7 Kingship"
    color: '#9fd0ff'
    lore: "First among the Theurgoi. He hammered the sky into being and rules the storm. His lightning answers only the worthy \u2014 and the doomed."
  - key: thalassar
    name: Thalassar, the Deep Sovereign
    domain: "Sea \xB7 Drowned Depths"
    color: '#4fd2c8'
    lore: Lord of every black fathom. The Drowned Temple was his once, before the mortals there forgot to fear the tide.
  - key: nyxara
    name: Nyxara, the Veiled Queen
    domain: "Night \xB7 Death \xB7 The Underway"
    color: '#9a6bff'
    lore: "Keeper of the dead and the dark between stars. The shades that haunt the ruins are hers \u2014 strayed, or sent."
  - key: sophiel
    name: Sophiel, the Grey-Eyed
    domain: "Wisdom \xB7 War-craft \xB7 Wards"
    color: '#bfc8d8'
    lore: She wove the first ward and the first stratagem. Her grey gaze misses nothing, and forgives little.
  - key: pyrrhon
    name: Pyrrhon, the Forgefather
    domain: "Fire \xB7 The Forge"
    color: '#ff7a3a'
    lore: Smith of the gods. He bound bronze guardians to walk a thousand years, and lit the first hex-fire in a mortal's hand.
  - key: koravel
    name: Koravel, the Green Crown
    domain: "Wild Growth \xB7 The Harvest"
    color: '#76e06b'
    lore: Goddess of root and ruin alike. The asphodel that blooms among the graves is her mercy to the dead.
  - key: aurelith
    name: Aurelith, the Dawnbearer
    domain: "Sun \xB7 Prophecy \xB7 Light"
    color: '#ffd76b'
    lore: Bearer of the dawn and the dread gift of foresight. It was her oracle who first spoke your name.
  regions:
  - id: mistwood
    name: The Mistwood
    subtitle: Cursed Forest
    description: A black wood drowned in fog, where the trees lean toward you when you are not looking.
    tileset: forest
    lightTint: '#cfe6d0'
    music: mist
    locked: 0
    ground:
      base: '#1a2a1e'
      accent: '#243a28'
    darkness: 0.62
    fog:
      color: '#7a9a8a'
      density: 0.5
    enemies:
    - mistling
    - hollowHound
    - gorgythe
    spawn:
      tx: 16
      ty: 28
  - id: temple
    name: The Drowned Temple
    subtitle: Forgotten Temple
    description: Marble halls half-claimed by black water, raised to a sea-god no one dares name aloud.
    tileset: temple
    lightTint: '#9fd0e0'
    music: temple
    locked: 1
    ground:
      base: '#16242e'
      accent: '#21323e'
    darkness: 0.55
    fog:
      color: '#6a8a9a'
      density: 0.35
    enemies:
    - mistling
    - bronzeWatcher
    - strix
    spawn:
      tx: 8
      ty: 30
  - id: ruins
    name: The Hollow Reach
    subtitle: Haunted Ruins
    description: A fallen city of broken colonnades, where the shades of its people still keep their endless watch.
    tileset: ruins
    lightTint: '#d8c0e8'
    music: ruins
    locked: 1
    ground:
      base: '#241f28'
      accent: '#352c3a'
    darkness: 0.6
    fog:
      color: '#8a7a9a'
      density: 0.4
    enemies:
    - mistling
    - gorgythe
    - strix
    - bronzeWatcher
    spawn:
      tx: 30
      ty: 30
  - id: caves
    name: The Underway
    subtitle: Shadowed Caves
    description: Lightless tunnels that wind down toward Nyxara's realm. The dark here is old, and it is listening.
    tileset: cave
    lightTint: '#b48aff'
    music: caves
    locked: 1
    ground:
      base: '#16121c'
      accent: '#241a2e'
    darkness: 0.85
    fog:
      color: '#3a2a4a'
      density: 0.25
    enemies:
    - hollowHound
    - gorgythe
    - mistling
    spawn:
      tx: 10
      ty: 10
  - id: citadel
    name: The Pale Citadel
    subtitle: Ancient Castle
    description: A fortress of bone-white stone on a black hill, its windows burning with cold, sourceless light.
    tileset: citadel
    lightTint: '#cdd6ff'
    music: citadel
    locked: 1
    ground:
      base: '#1c1d24'
      accent: '#2a2c36'
    darkness: 0.5
    fog:
      color: '#9aa0b8'
      density: 0.3
    enemies:
    - bronzeWatcher
    - strix
    - hollowHound
    spawn:
      tx: 24
      ty: 38
  - id: godreach
    name: The Threshold
    subtitle: Realm of the Theurgoi
    description: Where the marble of the gods meets the edge of the mortal sky. Lightning sleeps in the grass here.
    tileset: godreach
    lightTint: '#ffe8b0'
    music: godreach
    locked: 1
    ground:
      base: '#1e2436'
      accent: '#2c3650'
    darkness: 0.4
    fog:
      color: '#aab6e0'
      density: 0.25
    enemies:
    - bronzeWatcher
    - strix
    spawn:
      tx: 24
      ty: 40
  regionOrder:
  - mistwood
  - temple
  - ruins
  - caves
  - citadel
  - godreach
